.TH KEY_PRESSED 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
key_pressed \- True only on the frame the key went down
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqinput.h\(dq
.BI "bool key_pressed(const Input *in, Key k);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
True only on the frame the key went down. Use for one\-shot reactions (open a menu, jump, confirm, advance dialog). Holding the key does not repeat it; a second press requires a release first.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true if the key is down now and was up last frame.
.SH MODULE
input (src/engine/input/input.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR key_down (3),
.BR key_released (3),
.BR action_pressed (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
